{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 241, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n同\n意\n新\n四\n军\n由\n皖\n东\n分\n批\n渡\n江\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n一\n九\n四\n〇\n•\n \n一\n二\n•\n二\n九\n(\n一\n)\n同\n意\n直\n接\n移\n皖\n东\n分\n批\n渡\n江\n，\n一\n部\n分\n资\n材\n经\n苏\n南\n。\n(\n二\n)\n头\n几\n批\n可\n派\n得\n力\n干\n部\n率\n领\n，\n希\n夷\n可\n随\n中\n间\n几\n批\n渡\n江\n，\n项\n英\n行\n动\n中\n央\n另\n有\n指\n示\n。\n〇\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社\n \n一\n九\n八\n二\n. \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n同\n意\n新\n四\n军\n由\n皖\n东\n分\n批\n渡\n江\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n \n一 \n二\n二\n九\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "df7f7497e16f99f5bb1251872aed919ae52055f6f1d16427372fdc0aaedd1b58", "text_chars": 332}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 242, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 243, "text": "关\n于\n缓\n复\n刘\n为\n章\n电\n等\n问\n题\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n一\n九\n四\n〇\n•\n \n一 \n二\n•\n三\n〇\n(\n一\n)\n复\n刘\n为\n章\n电\n，\n前\n稿\n既\n不\n发\n，\n大\n家\n意\n见\n以\n拖\n一\n下\n为\n好\n。\n他\n们\n反\n共\n，\n让\n他\n们\n去\n反\n，\n剿\n共\n也\n让\n他\n们\n \n来\n剿\n，\n反\n得\n全\n国\n天\n怒\n人\n怨\n，\n那\n时\n我\n再\n表\n示\n态\n度\n，\n率\n性\n不\n着\n急\n。\n(\n一 \n一\n)\n「\n齐\n电\n」\n是\n要\n驳\n的\n，\n也\n待\n明\n年\n一\n月\n或\n一\n \n一\n月\n再\n驳\n。\n(\n三\n)\n「\n齐\n电\n」\n文\n字\n错\n得\n一\n塌\n糊\n涂\n，\n一\n面\n请\n用\n战\n报\n台\n再\n发\n一\n次\n，\n一\n面\n请\n告\n刘\n为\n章\n要\n他\n用\n官\n电\n发\n来\n， \n因\n电\n报\n局\n捣\n乱\n，\n由\n他\n们\n自\n己\n发\n或\n错\n得\n少\n些\n。\n(\n四\n)\n皖\n北\n互\n让\n可\n不\n提\n，\n提\n了\n使\n桂\n系\n轻\n视\n我\n们\n，\n待\n我\n主\n力\n休\n整\n好\n后\n是\n要\n给\n以\n打\n击\n的\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社\n \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n关\n于\n缓\n复\n刘\n为\n章\n电\n等\n问\n题\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n \n一 \n一\n四\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e8b8c62c6515e1acc96f3c2097a8fffb0d3aef4ee78c82abe18ae7ab2a5473e4", "text_chars": 546}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 244, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 245, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n应\n分\n批\n走\n苏\n南\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n一\n九\n四\n〇\n•\n一\n二\n•\n三\n〇\n据\n恩\n来\n称\n：\n「\n江\n南\n部\n队\n分\n地\n渡\n江\n有\n危\n险\n，\n皖\n北\n让\n路\n，\n蒋\n虽\n口\n头\n答\n应\n，\n但\n让\n出\n巢\n、\n无\n、\n和\n、\n含\n四\n县\n恐\n \n不\n易\n，\n李\n品\n仙\n已\n在\n布\n置\n袭\n击\n我\n的\n阴\n谋\n，\n仍\n以\n分\n批\n走\n苏\n南\n为\n好\n」\n等\n语\n。\n我\n们\n同\n意\n恩\n来\n意\n见\n，\n分\n批\n走\n苏\n南\n为\n \n好\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社\n \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n应\n分\n批\n走\n苏\n南\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n \n一 \n一\n四\n三\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "b315ed72d11a326f0bf01eb2df7d35ef2ff2d2c23a6a34b8ebd31269bce1aec8", "text_chars": 373}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 246, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 247, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n立\n即\n开\n往\n苏\n南\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n一\n九\n四\n一\n.\n一\n.\n三\n你\n们\n全\n部\n坚\n决\n开\n苏\n南\n，\n并\n立\n即\n开\n动\n，\n是\n完\n全\n正\n确\n的\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社\n \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n立\n即\n开\n往\n苏\n南\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英 \n一 \n一\n四\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "735417ef14e52440ac8f68577fa2b9957cefa53faa5b6b98b8282469a8c90002", "text_chars": 230}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 248, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 249, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n应\n迅\n速\n离\n茂\n林\n东\n进\n突\n围\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n.\n一 \n•\n七\n你\n们\n在\n茂\n林\n不\n宜\n久\n留\n，\n只\n要\n宣\n城\n、\n宁\n国\n一\n带\n情\n况\n明\n了\n后\n，\n即\n宜\n东\n进\n，\n乘\n顽\n军\n布\n置\n未\n就\n，\n突\n过\n其\n包\n围\n \n线\n为\n有\n利\n。\n〇\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二\n•\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n应\n迅\n速\n离\n茂\n林\n东\n进\n突\n围\n致\n叶\n挺\n、\n项\n英 \n一 \n一\n四\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "5b4903c7cacfa6be32bdb1e02b8fb3c8e94265583e60654853081441678e3422", "text_chars": 291}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 250, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 251, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n向\n刘\n少\n奇\n查\n询\n项\n英\n等\n情\n况\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n一 \n•\n九\n你\n说\n项\n、\n袁\n□\n已\n离\n开\n部\n队\n，\n我\n们\n尚\n未\n接\n到\n此\n项\n消\n息\n。\n他\n们\n何\n时\n离\n开\n的\n，\n现\n到\n何\n处\n，\n希\n夷\n、\n小\n姚\n情\n形\n \n如\n何\n，\n军\n队\n情\n形\n如\n何\n，\n望\n即\n告\n我\n们\n。\n得\n叶\n、\n项\n五\n日\n报\n告\n，\n他\n们\n四\n日\n夜\n间\n开\n动\n，\n五\n日\n晨\n到\n太\n平\n、\n泾\n县\n间\n， \n此\n后\n即\n不\n明\n了\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n向\n刘\n少\n奇\n查\n询\n项\n英\n等\n情\n况 \n一 \n一\n四\n九\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "573c9402483fe4fed374f8830c9d496164fa4af8dc00ac705c85a284475f936e", "text_chars": 345}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 252, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 253, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n领\n导\n问\n题\n致\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n陈\n毅\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n• \n一 \n•\n \n一 \n一\n你\n们\n转\n来\n叶\n、\n姚\n报\n告\n悉\n，\n叶\n、\n姚\n是\n完\n全\n正\n确\n的\n，\n望\n你\n们\n就\n近\n随\n时\n帮\n助\n他\n们\n，\n并\n加\n鼓\n励\n。\n惟\n项\n英\n撤\n职\n \n点\n暂\n不\n必\n提\n。\n另\n指\n示\n即\n转\n叶\n、\n姚\n为\n要\n。\no\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n领\n导\n问\n题\n致\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n陈\n毅 \n二\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "454eb2bee96a02cd0f498df533b47556fff4f1faf4a8c92c8a22ca00923e739b", "text_chars": 310}
